{"id":"chatcmpl-2fcd1056-efd4-4269-9cd2-1bbbace94937","object":"chat.completion","created":1795229072,"model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","reasoning_content":"","content":"```json\n{\n  \"highlights\": \"This task demonstrates a visual medical reasoning workflow where ambiguous spatial orientation in imaging requires both anatomical reasoning and specialized tool consultation. The successful strategy combined initial visual analysis with expert tool verification to resolve lateralization uncertainty, then committed to the most anatomically consistent interpretation.\",\n  \"patterns\": [\n    \"When visual orientation cues are ambiguous, reason through anatomical landmarks first before consulting specialized tools.\",\n    \"Use domain-specific expert tools to resolve uncertainty that cannot be settled by general visual inspection alone.\",\n    \"When forced to choose between binary options under uncertainty, select the interpretation most consistent with standard conventions and anatomical priors.\",\n    \"Treat image markers (laterality labels, orientation tags) as primary evidence but validate against anatomical structure before concluding.\"\n  ],\n  \"playbooks\": {\n    \"Medical imaging interpretation\": \"Identify view type (frontal/lateral) first, then use anatomical landmarks (spine, sternum, heart shadow) to establish orientation before localizing findings.\",\n    \"Ambiguous binary classification\": \"When two options are mutually exclusive and evidence is partial, weigh standard conventions and anatomical priors to break ties rather than abstaining.\",\n    \"Tool-assisted reasoning\": \"Invoke a specialized expert tool when general reasoning reaches its limit; frame the tool query to ask specifically about the uncertain dimension.\"\n  },\n  \"checklists\": [\n    \"Confirm image view type and orientation markers before localizing any finding.\",\n    \"Cross-check visual conclusion against expert tool output before finalizing the answer.\"\n  ]\n}\n```"},"finish_reason":"stop","logprobs":null}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":785,"total_tokens":1095,"completion_tokens":310,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":785},"completion_tokens_details":{"text_tokens":310}}}